    <title lang="fr">Prédateurs de génie</title>
    <sub-title lang="fr">Les arènes</sub-title>
    <desc lang="fr">Savuti is big cat country, where only the most resourceful predators thrive. This film follows three characters through winter as small game vanishes and buffalo arrive. The Marsh Pride faces tough terrain and rival lions, while Saba, the matriarch, struggles after a hyena attack. A lone female leopard adapts her hunting strategy to survive in a lion-dominated landscape. Through nighttime hunts and clever use of terrain, these predators battle Savuti's harsh conditions and each other.</desc>
