  </programme>
  
<programme channel="IN8000186A" start="20261001083006 +0000" stop="20261001102913 +0000">
    <title>THE SHARK DIVERS</title>
    <desc>A Select Group Of Skilled Professionals Routinely Work With Dangerous Sharks As They Study, Photograph, And Interact With Them. The Fish Range From The Massive Cold-Water Sharks In Canada To Great Whites In Mexico And South Africa, And The Tiger Sharks In The Bahamas. While The Whale Shark Attracts A Devoted Following And You Can Now Scuba-Dive With Them In Aquariums, Is The Popularity Of The Activity Endangering The Same Sharks?</desc>
    <icon src="https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/IN_USQT620324A_3289127582_3_20260805T130500789Z_1_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-9468c5484-7b9vr.jpeg" />
